<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pixar '97 estimate raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pixar '97 estimate raised.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson Stephens &amp; Co analyst Keith Benjamin raised his 1997 earnings estimate on Pixar Corp to $0.29 a share from $0.26 following the company's report Thursday of second quarter earnings of $0.19 a share.</p>
<p>-- In a statement, Benjamin said there is upside potential to the 1997 estimate based on new projects not yet announced.</p>
<p>-- Pixar shares were up 1-5/8 at 17-1/2 by midday.</p>
